3. How we use your information?
We use your information to:
Fulfill your requests, such as Product orders and responses to email questions;
Support our core business functions, such as order fulfillment, internal business process management, authentication, loss and fraud prevention, and public safety functions;
Communicate with you about our Products and promotions;
Provide the Sites and Stores to you;
Improve our Sites, Products, and Stores;
Maintain your Ulta Beauty account and Loyalty Program membership;
Provide you access to the Ulta Beauty Community;
Improve our marketing and promotions;
Statistically analyze the usage of our Sites, Products, Communications, and Stores;
Contact you;
Resolve disputes, investigate problems, and enforce our terms;
Reconcile data across internal platforms to maintain accuracy and personalize services;
Help diagnose problems with our server, manage our Sites, and to enhance our Products; and
Perform a business transaction, such as a merger, acquisition, sale of assets, bankruptcy, or related transactions.
We may offer AI-powered shopping, product discovery, recommendation, virtual beauty, and related commerce experiences through our Sites and third-party platforms. When you interact with these experiences, we may process information you provide, including beauty interests, Product preferences, Product-related questions, shopping activity, and other information necessary to generate recommendations, Product comparisons, Product bundles, routines, shopping suggestions, virtual beauty experiences, and related services. We may use information processed through these experiences to provide and improve these experiences, personalize recommendations, troubleshoot issues, maintain platform security, support analytics and reporting, and support our business operations. We may work with service providers and technology partners that assist us in operating these experiences and generating responses.
